# Per-machine and generated. The project's own committed state is the source, app.json, eas.json
# and the three generated data files (assets/*.png, src/phone/vectors.json,
# src/phone/present/fixtures.json) — which ARE committed, so CI needs nothing from the desktop.
node_modules/
.expo/
dist/
web-build/
# expo prebuild output. The managed workflow generates these on EAS from app.json; a committed
# copy would silently outrank the config everybody actually edits.
android/
ios/
# Signing material, if a local build ever produces any. NEVER commit one of these.
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p8
*.p12
*.mobileprovision
